inscription~
   The inscription reads:

   "As the Moriquendi passed on and the transformation of the Overseer 
occurred, a great land was created, torn between good and evil.  One half of 
the land dwells in darkness, as that of the heart of the Overseer, one half 
of the land dwells in light, as that of the Moriquendi.  It is said that 
the hearts of the two Immortals are buried there.  
    
    A great warrior is destined to retrieve the hearts and combine them
to form a ring which will unite evil and goodness in neutrality.  That
warrior must bring the hearts here to unite them and bring peace.  Lo!
There is a great force dwelling within the Dominion which will attempt to
keep the two forces apart.  Only he that possesses true courage and a
soul without turmoil may complete this quest."

~
S
